---
layout: base.njk
nav: analysis
permalink: /analyses/1260h/
title: "DoW § 1260H — Chinese military companies: list and removal history"
description: The current Section 1260H list of Chinese military companies and every removal since the first list in June 2021, quoted from the government's own documents.
---
{% set h = ledger.history %}
<article class="ledger-page history-page">
  <div class="crumb"><a href="/">The file</a> › <a href="/analyses/">Analyses</a> › <a href="/analyses/supply-chain-watch-lists/">Watch lists</a></div>
  <h1>DoW § 1260H — Chinese military companies</h1>
  {% if not h %}
  <p class="empty">The removal history has not been published yet.</p>
  {% else %}
  <p class="sub">The current list, and every removal since June 2021 in the government's own words.</p>

  <details class="prov" id="method">
    <summary>Sources &amp; how to read this page — FY2021 NDAA § 1260H, 10 U.S.C. § 113 note{% if h.list %} · as of {{ h.list.currency_date }}{% endif %}</summary>
    <ul class="method">
      <li>Reasons are quoted word for word from the document linked beside them. An ellipsis (…) marks words left out; the full text is in the linked document.</li>
      <li><b>Bold</b> markers — “No specific reason stated in …” and “No removal notice; no reason stated.” — are this site's. The absence of a stated reason implies nothing.</li>
      <li>A <i>group heading</i> is printed once over several names; an <i>entity note</i> is printed beside one name.</li>
      <li>“Removed” is the date the removing document was published. Where the Federal Register and the Department's list PDF differ, both are linked.</li>
      <li>Archived copies are Wayback Machine captures, kept because <code>media.defense.gov</code> may refuse automated access.</li>
      <li>Not legal advice and not an official source. Leaving this list is not a finding about a company's status under any other list.</li>
    </ul>
    {% if h.list %}{% set lhref = h.list.source_url | govsource %}
    <div class="row"><div>Current list</div><div class="meta">{% if lhref %}<a href="{{ lhref }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Department of War list</a>{% endif %}</div></div>{% endif %}
    {% for s in h.pdf_sources %}
    <div class="row"><div>DoW list PDF {{ s.release_date }}<span class="basis">SHA-256 {{ s.sha256 }}</span></div>
      <div class="meta">{% set so = s.official_url | govsource %}{% if so %}<a href="{{ so }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">official</a>{% endif %}{% set sa = s.archived_url | archivesource %}{% if sa %} · <a href="{{ sa }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">archived</a>{% endif %}</div></div>
    {% endfor %}
  </details>

  <h2 id="current">On the list now <span class="meta">({{ h.current.length }})</span></h2>
  <div class="scroll">
  <table class="ltable current">
    <colgroup><col style="width:34%"><col style="width:26%"><col style="width:24%"><col style="width:16%"></colgroup>
    <thead><tr><th>Entity</th><th>AKA</th><th>Listed under</th><th>Cite</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for c in h.current %}
      <tr><td>{{ c.name }}</td>
        <td>{{ c.aka | join('; ') }}</td>
        <td>{{ c.parent }}</td>
        <td>{% set ch = c.source_url | govsource %}{% if ch %}<a href="{{ ch }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ c.cite }}</a>{% else %}{{ c.cite }}{% endif %}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>

  <h2 id="removals">Removals <span class="meta">({{ h.removals }})</span></h2>
  <div class="scroll">
  <table class="ltable history">
    <colgroup><col style="width:28%"><col style="width:12%"><col style="width:40%"><col style="width:20%"></colgroup>
    <thead><tr><th>Entity</th><th>Removed</th><th>Reason</th><th>Sources</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for e in h.events | reverse %}
      {% set r = e | briefreason %}
      <tr id="{{ 'removed' if e.event == 'removal' else 'relisted' }}-{{ e.name | slugify }}"{% if e.event != 'removal' %} class="relist"{% endif %}>
        <td>{{ e.name }}{% if e.aka and e.aka.length %}<span class="basis">also {{ e.aka | join('; ') }}</span>{% endif %}
          {% if e.status and e.status != "removed" %}<span class="basis">{{ e.status }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
        <td class="date">{% if e.event == "removal" %}{{ e.removed_on }}{% else %}re-listed {{ e.date }}{% endif %}</td>
        <td>
          {% if e.event == "removal" and e.reason and (e.reason.startsWith("No specific reason stated") or not e.statements.length) %}<b>{{ e.reason }}</b>
          {% elif r %}“{{ r.quote }}”<span class="basis">{{ "stated ground" if r.role == "reason" else "notice text" }} · {{ r.scope }}{% if r.over > 1 %} over {{ r.over }} names{% endif %}</span>{% endif %}
          {% for a in e.absent_from or [] %}<span class="basis">{{ a }}</span>{% endfor %}
          {% if e.reader_note %}{% if e.reader_note.length <= 200 %}<span class="basis">{{ (e.reader_note | replace(e.reason, "") | trim) if e.reason else e.reader_note }}</span>
          {% else %}<span class="basis"><a href="#name-{{ e.name | slugify }}">Editor's note ↓</a></span>{% endif %}{% endif %}
        </td>
        <td class="src">
          {% set sh = e.source_url | govsource %}{% if sh %}<a href="{{ sh }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ e.cite }}</a>{% else %}{{ e.cite }}{% endif %}
          {% set seen = [e.cite] %}
          {% for x in e.statements %}{% if x.cite not in seen %}{% set seen = (seen.push(x.cite), seen) %}
            {% set offh = (x.official_url or x.pdf_url) | govsource %}
            {% if offh %}<a href="{{ offh }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ x.cite }}</a>{% else %}<span>{{ x.cite }}</span>{% endif %}
          {% endif %}{% endfor %}
          {% set archs = [] %}
          {% for x in e.statements %}{% set arch = x.archived_url | archivesource %}{% if arch and arch not in archs %}{% set archs = (archs.push(arch), archs) %}
            <a href="{{ arch }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">archived copy</a>
          {% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>

  {% if h.decisions.length %}
  <h2 id="names">Names that changed between lists</h2>
  <ul class="names">
    {% for d in h.decisions %}{% if d.kind != "no_notice" %}
    <li id="name-{{ d.name | slugify }}"><b>{{ d.name }}</b>{% if d.to %} → {{ d.to }}{% endif %}
      <span class="meta">· {{ {"rename": "renamed, as the list states", "different_name": "printed under a different name", "alias": "not printed; parent still listed (editor's decision)", "listed_elsewhere": "still listed"}[d.kind] }} · {{ d.transition }}</span>
      <span class="basis">{{ d.reader_note }}</span></li>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% endif %}
  {% endif %}
</article>
